<Placemark><name>A1 Unsurveyed forest massif 20 km east of Mount Mabu (Mozambique)</name><styleUrl>#tA</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[After Mabu itself, this is the strongest tall-canopy (&gt;20 m) signal in northern Mozambique: about 11 km² on a ridge with about 940 m of relief. It may be the next 'Google Earth forest'.<br/>NOVEL-SYNTHESIS | radius 3 km]]></description><LookAt><longitude>36.586</longitude><latitude>-16.304</latitude><altitude>0</altitude><range>14000.0</range><tilt>30</tilt><heading>0</heading></LookAt><Point><coordinates>36.586,-16.304,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
