<Placemark><name>B8 Lhende Khola 2026 landslide-dam site (Nepal-Tibet)</name><styleUrl>#tB</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[The 2026 barrier lake reported by Chinese state TV and Nepal's NDRRMA/ICIMOD. The team pinned its location independently from Sentinel-2 debris and DEM elevation, which matched the published reports. It drained by late September 2026.<br/>KNOWN | radius 1 km]]></description><LookAt><longitude>85.484</longitude><latitude>28.334</latitude><altitude>0</altitude><range>6000.0</range><tilt>30</tilt><heading>0</heading></LookAt><Point><coordinates>85.484,28.334,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
