<Placemark><name>A2 Field of rimmed bowl craters, Amadror/Tefedest (Algeria)</name><styleUrl>#tA</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[The global crater scan found at least 7 rimmed bowls 0.45-1.35 km wide and 30-135 m deep in dark rock. Their clustering points to a volcanic maar or tuff-ring field, not an impact.<br/>NOVEL-SYNTHESIS | radius 20 km]]></description><LookAt><longitude>6.13</longitude><latitude>25.26</latitude><altitude>0</altitude><range>40000.0</range><tilt>30</tilt><heading>0</heading></LookAt><Point><coordinates>6.13,25.26,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
