<Placemark><name>B6 Australasian tektite crater: a falsifiable test of Bolaven</name><styleUrl>#tB</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[This is the source of the largest young strewn field (788 ka), still missing. Two lava flows inside Sieh et al.'s proposed outline are magnetically reversed. If they date to more than 788 ka, Bolaven is falsified; if they date to 773-788 ka, it is strongly supported.<br/>PARTLY-KNOWN | radius 10 km]]></description><LookAt><longitude>106.271</longitude><latitude>15.203</latitude><altitude>0</altitude><range>40000.0</range><tilt>30</tilt><heading>0</heading></LookAt><Point><coordinates>106.271,15.203,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
