<Placemark><name>A3 Giant round doline, Darai Plateau (PNG)</name><styleUrl>#tA</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[A near-perfect closed sinkhole about 1.3 km across and about 260 m deep in the Copernicus DEM, inside the Darai polygonal karst.<br/>PARTLY-KNOWN | radius 0.5 km]]></description><LookAt><longitude>143.2436</longitude><latitude>-6.8594</latitude><altitude>0</altitude><range>5000.0</range><tilt>30</tilt><heading>0</heading></LookAt><Point><coordinates>143.2436,-6.8594,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
