<Placemark><name>H8 Atil, the Khazar capital, tested at Samosdelka (Volga delta)</name><styleUrl>#tB</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[Raised ground on both banks of a 250-300 m channel, with an island at a fork, matches the Arab 'twin city on both banks' layout. Each bank is far smaller than the accounts imply, though, and a 2020 review rejected the identification.<br/>PROPOSED | radius 3 km]]></description><LookAt><longitude>47.8398</longitude><latitude>46.024</latitude><altitude>0</altitude><range>8000.0</range><tilt>30</tilt><heading>0</heading></LookAt><Point><coordinates>47.8398,46.024,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
