<Placemark><name>H9 Ekallatum zone, 18 km north of Assur: a salvage priority</name><styleUrl>#tB</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[Ekallatum was Shamshi-Adad I's royal city. The published '18 km north of Assur, west bank' lands on a terrace-edge town, and no floodplain tell of 4 m or more lies below it. The whole valley is in the Makhul dam reservoir zone, where construction resumed in 2021. (Location rounded to about 10 km in the public copy.)<br/>PROPOSED | radius 10 km]]></description><LookAt><longitude>43.2</longitude><latitude>35.6</latitude><altitude>0</altitude><range>40000.0</range><tilt>30</tilt><heading>0</heading></LookAt><Point><coordinates>43.2,35.6,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
