<Placemark><name>H11 Zalpuwa 'on the sea' at İkiztepe (Kızılırmak delta)</name><styleUrl>#tB</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[An isolated 22 m hill at the inner edge of a delta that held lagoons until about 4,000 years ago, 7.7 km from today's coast. That fits Zalpuwa 'on the sea' in the Old Assyrian era.<br/>PROPOSED | radius 3 km]]></description><LookAt><longitude>35.8436</longitude><latitude>41.6189</latitude><altitude>0</altitude><range>8000.0</range><tilt>30</tilt><heading>0</heading></LookAt><Point><coordinates>35.8436,41.6189,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
