<Placemark><name>B4 Ho-lao-lo-kia, Xuanzang's sand-buried city</name><styleUrl>#tB</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[Xuanzang places it north of Khotan, with a survivor who fled east to Pi-mo (Uzun-tati), and says it was already a sand mound in 644. That rules out Dandan Oilik, Karadong and Yuansha. The DEM puts the dry downstream end of Pi-mo's streams here.<br/>PARTLY-KNOWN | radius 30 km]]></description><LookAt><longitude>80.58</longitude><latitude>37.55</latitude><altitude>0</altitude><range>60000.0</range><tilt>30</tilt><heading>0</heading></LookAt><Point><coordinates>80.58,37.55,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
