<Placemark><name>B7 Njimi, first capital of Kanem = Tié?</name><styleUrl>#tB</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[DAI/Frobenius identification: a 3.2 ha fired-brick enclosure locally called 'Njimi-ye', dated to the 11th-14th centuries, about 45 km east of Mao.<br/>PROPOSED | radius 8 km]]></description><LookAt><longitude>15.729</longitude><latitude>14.121</latitude><altitude>0</altitude><range>20000.0</range><tilt>30</tilt><heading>0</heading></LookAt><Point><coordinates>15.729,14.121,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
