<Placemark><name>H10 Merrha of Isidore of Charax = Mari (Tell Hariri)?</name><styleUrl>#tB</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[Five schoeni below Dura, with the schoenus calibrated on the Dura-Anatho leg, lands 2.6 km from Mari along the river. The name Merrha echoes Mari. (Location rounded to about 10 km in the public copy.)<br/>NOVEL-SYNTHESIS | radius 10 km]]></description><LookAt><longitude>40.9</longitude><latitude>34.6</latitude><altitude>0</altitude><range>40000.0</range><tilt>30</tilt><heading>0</heading></LookAt><Point><coordinates>40.9,34.6,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
