<Placemark><name>H12 al-Afa'iya water station on the Darb Zubayda pilgrim road (Saudi Arabia)</name><styleUrl>#tB</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[The 32/34-mile interpolation between Mahd adh-Dhahab and Faydat al-Mislah falls 1.25 km from a bright 70-90 m square at the edge of a clay pan. It could be a plastered birka (Abbasid reservoir). (Location rounded to about 10 km in the public copy.)<br/>PROPOSED | radius 14 km]]></description><LookAt><longitude>40.8</longitude><latitude>23.0</latitude><altitude>0</altitude><range>40000.0</range><tilt>30</tilt><heading>0</heading></LookAt><Point><coordinates>40.8,23.0,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
