<Folder><name>Meteorites</name>
<Placemark><name>B3 Chinguetti meteorite: the never-searched midpoint</name><styleUrl>#tB</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[In 1916 Ripert reported a 100 m iron 'hill'. The blacksmiths' account puts a house-sized iron block halfway to Ouadane (about 46 km). The 2024 route paper searched only 12-22 km out. A straight ridge about 60 m high and 20 km long here has never been examined.<br/>NOVEL-SYNTHESIS | radius 12 km]]></description><LookAt><longitude>-11.94</longitude><latitude>20.68</latitude><altitude>0</altitude><range>40000.0</range><tilt>30</tilt><heading>0</heading></LookAt><Point><coordinates>-11.94,20.68,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
