<Placemark><name>H1 Oval fortified mound with keep and moat, east of Zaranj (Afghan Sistan)</name><styleUrl>#tA</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[An 11.5 m oval mound (210 × 135 m) with a 45 m rectangular building on top and a ring about 300 m across around it, like a moat or outer wall. A 70 m square enclosure sits 2.3 km NNW. It has the shape of a Sistan qal'a. (Location rounded to about 10 km in the public copy.)<br/>NOVEL-SYNTHESIS | radius 10 km]]></description><LookAt><longitude>62.0</longitude><latitude>30.9</latitude><altitude>0</altitude><range>40000.0</range><tilt>30</tilt><heading>0</heading></LookAt><Point><coordinates>62.0,30.9,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
