<Placemark><name>H2 Abandoned grid town around a 12.7 m tell, NE of Pust-i Gau (Afghan Sistan)</name><styleUrl>#tA</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[A rectilinear grid of compounds covering at least 1 km² around a roughly 200 m mound. Its tone in the short-wave infrared matches the mud-brick walls of Pust-i Gau, 6 km away. (Location rounded to about 10 km in the public copy.)<br/>NOVEL-SYNTHESIS | radius 10 km]]></description><LookAt><longitude>62.1</longitude><latitude>31.3</latitude><altitude>0</altitude><range>40000.0</range><tilt>30</tilt><heading>0</heading></LookAt><Point><coordinates>62.1,31.3,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
