<Placemark><name>H3 Square walled enclosure (qal'a?) on a rise, Afghan Sistan</name><styleUrl>#tA</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[A crisp 100 m square with thick walls (black in SWIR) and a 30-40 m ring beside it, on an 8.6 m rise. It is either a caravanserai or fort, or a modern compound or security post. (Location rounded to about 10 km in the public copy.)<br/>NOVEL-SYNTHESIS | radius 10 km]]></description><LookAt><longitude>62.1</longitude><latitude>30.9</latitude><altitude>0</altitude><range>40000.0</range><tilt>30</tilt><heading>0</heading></LookAt><Point><coordinates>62.1,30.9,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
