<Placemark><name>H13 Round wooded settlement mounds, central Mali</name><styleUrl>#tB</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[The DEM tell finder found a 55 ha, 6 m round mound with a dark wooded cap beside the river. A second one, 85 ha and 12 m, sits at [location withheld]. Their shape is typical of abandoned Middle Niger towns. Regional registers could not be checked. (Location rounded to about 10 km in the public copy.)<br/>NOVEL-SYNTHESIS | radius 10 km]]></description><LookAt><longitude>-5.5</longitude><latitude>13.2</latitude><altitude>0</altitude><range>40000.0</range><tilt>30</tilt><heading>0</heading></LookAt><Point><coordinates>-5.5,13.2,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
